---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About the Studio & Founders"
  description="Meet the three founders behind Algoryxz: Smarak, Deeptiman, and Akriti. A modern digital studio based in Bhubaneswar, Odisha."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="page-header">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Studio Origin & Philosophy</span>
        <h1 class="page-title">Taste, Engineering Rigor & Founder Directness</h1>
        <p class="page-lead">
          Algoryxz was founded in Bhubaneswar, Odisha, by three engineering and design partners who believed digital development shouldn't be caught between slow, bloated agencies and fragile DIY templates.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="philosophy-grid">
        <div class="philosophy-item">
          <span class="philo-num">01</span>
          <h3>Internal AI Rigor</h3>
          <p>
            We use AI coding agents as our engine room to eliminate boilerplate and automate CI/CD pipelines. But AI is not what we sell. We sell finished, audited accountability.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="philosophy-item">
          <span class="philo-num">02</span>
          <h3>Founder Direct Access</h3>
          <p>
            When you collaborate with Algoryxz, you work directly with Smarak, Deeptiman, and Akriti. No account executives, no junior contractor relay chains, no communication lag.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="philosophy-item">
          <span class="philo-num">03</span>
          <h3>Edge Performance</h3>
          <p>
            We deploy globally on Cloudflare Pages. Our websites load in milliseconds, have zero unnecessary client runtime overhead, and eliminate recurring hosting markups.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="founders-section-about">
        <h2 class="founders-heading">The Founders</h2>
        <div class="founders-cards-stack">
          <div class="founder-card-about">
            <div class="founder-meta">
              <span class="badge badge-internal">Architecture</span>
              <span class="founder-location">Bhubaneswar, Odisha</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="founder-name">Smarak</h3>
            <p class="founder-title">Co-Founder, Engineering & Systems</p>
            <p class="founder-text">
              Specializes in distributed systems, modern edge architecture, TypeScript, and AI agent integration. Smarak oversees all technical feasibility, backend systems, database schemas, and production deployment pipelines.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="founder-card-about">
            <div class="founder-meta">
              <span class="badge badge-concept">Art Direction</span>
              <span class="founder-location">Bhubaneswar, Odisha</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="founder-name">Deeptiman</h3>
            <p class="founder-title">Co-Founder, Creative & Design Direction</p>
            <p class="founder-text">
              Directs visual identity, typography hierarchies, motion choreography, and layout aesthetics. Deeptiman ensures that every release feels bespoke, intentional, and editorial rather than template-assembled.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="founder-card-about">
            <div class="founder-meta">
              <span class="badge badge-client">Operations</span>
              <span class="founder-location">Bhubaneswar, Odisha</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="founder-name">Akriti</h3>
            <p class="founder-title">Co-Founder, Operations, Delivery & QA</p>
            <p class="founder-text">
              Oversees delivery schedules, client onboarding, content readiness, and physical real-device quality assurance. Akriti serves as the final gatekeeper before custom domains cut over to production.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-16);
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  .section-eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .page-title {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .philosophy-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-20);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-16);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-hairline);
  }

  .philosophy-item {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-hairline);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .philo-num {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .philosophy-item h3 {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .philosophy-item p {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
  }

  .founders-heading {
    font-size: var(--font-size-2xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .founders-cards-stack {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .founder-card-about {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-hairline);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .founder-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .founder-location {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .founder-name {
    font-size: var(--font-size-2xl);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .founder-title {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .founder-text {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .philosophy-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }

    .founders-cards-stack {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
